$3.$\n\nTherefore, the point $(-6,9)$ on $f(x)$ is mapped to the point $(3\\cdot (-6),9)=(-18,9),$ and this point must lie on the graph of $y=f(\\frac{1}{3}x)$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0dc935dc-f462-5bbc-b210-6779d4c833a1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0dc935dc-f462-5bbc-b210-6779d4c833a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0dc935dc-f462-5bbc-b210-6779d4c833a1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b2ab2f07-2154-5eaf-9f99-57f63be7b49d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b2ab2f07-2154-5eaf-9f99-57f63be7b49d" "answer-e91d2864-f866-5e4b-b852-31fa590ce52f" "answer-60c7ef0e-ae5f-5788-8442-58796873f024" "answer-84e944cf-269e-5563-8b06-449f37d3b2c4" "answer-d0e15f87-be8f-5c3b-8a1b-1ee813c884df"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2ab2f07-2154-5eaf-9f99-57f63be7b49d" :answer/id #uuid "b2ab2f07-2154-5eaf-9f99-57f63be7b49d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-18,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e91d2864-f866-5e4b-b852-31fa590ce52f" :answer/id #uuid "e91d2864-f866-5e4b-b852-31fa590ce52f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-60c7ef0e-ae5f-5788-8442-58796873f024" :answer/id #uuid "60c7ef0e-ae5f-5788-8442-58796873f024" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,9)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-84e944cf-269e-5563-8b06-449f37d3b2c4" :answer/id #uuid "84e944cf-269e-5563-8b06-449f37d3b2c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-6,27)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d0e15f87-be8f-5c3b-8a1b-1ee813c884df" :answer/id #uuid "d0e15f87-be8f-5c3b-8a1b-1ee813c884df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-6,3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-8ba8307c-0927-500a-9059-3ec8e4b67d43" :activity/id #uuid "8ba8307c-0927-500a-9059-3ec8e4b67d43" :activity/title "Horizontal Stretches of Functions" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186050676 :activity/course 17592186046647 :activity/steps ["step-7de9a451-20cb-530d-be6d-f500ce4d71dc" "step-2fd6cb82-b73f-5f34-aa6e-4be98186d7a6" "step-88584094-7c93-5f8c-acd3-2211dd446362"] :activity/first-step "step-7de9a451-20cb-530d-be6d-f500ce4d71dc" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-7de9a451-20cb-530d-be6d-f500ce4d71dc" :step/id #uuid "7de9a451-20cb-530d-be6d-f500ce4d71dc" :step/content "question-28d08449-f19d-5dae-9ff9-1b1d3bcb8500" :step/next "step-2fd6cb82-b73f-5f34-aa6e-4be98186d7a6" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-2fd6cb82-b73f-5f34-aa6e-4be98186d7a6" :step/id #uuid "2fd6cb82-b73f-5f34-aa6e-4be98186d7a6" :step/content "question-d363b88c-fb75-5b26-bd10-c56875f40c1e" :step/next "step-88584094-7c93-5f8c-acd3-2211dd446362" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-88584094-7c93-5f8c-acd3-2211dd446362" :step/id #uuid "88584094-7c93-5f8c-acd3-2211dd446362" :step/content "question-7ec57449-f520-50b3-b823-1f98b4f880f3" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096720 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-fbeb0099-1c78-5b43-8e43-b8ec47f11368" "question-a23536ce-7cba-5974-838f-a84131e7f6d9"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-fbeb0099-1c78-5b43-8e43-b8ec47f11368" :question/id #uuid "fbeb0099-1c78-5b43-8e43-b8ec47f11368" :question/math-academy-id "q-50028" :question/problem "A fly’s position relative to a fixed origin $O$ is given by the function $x(t)=\\frac{t}{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}t)\\,\\text{m},$ where $t$ is the time in minutes. Find its average position of the fly between $0$ and $2$ minutes." :question/worked-solution "To calculate the average value of the position on $[{t}_{1},{t}_{2}],$ we use the average value formula\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{avg}}=\\frac{1}{{t}_{2}-{t}_{1}}\\,{\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}x(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{2-0}\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}(\\frac{t}{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}t))\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{(\\frac{{t}^{2}}{4}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}t))|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}((\\frac{{2}^{2}}{4}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}\\cdot 2))-(\\frac{{0}^{2}}{4}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}\\cdot 0))) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}((1+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})-(0+1)) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average position is $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\,\\text{m}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1f66651c-8f9c-52e6-9972-14e6f7d0c2a3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1f66651c-8f9c-52e6-9972-14e6f7d0c2a3" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f66651c-8f9c-52e6-9972-14e6f7d0c2a3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e0fc4746-3be8-5122-9467-181003e3756b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-1d1be747-8a94-5aed-aafa-3f8e379525df" "answer-a6c9df96-aec1-55e9-a6fa-579b1f853ec1" "answer-e0fc4746-3be8-5122-9467-181003e3756b" "answer-59823227-e905-5977-a5d2-bb84aa45354b" "answer-2bcb7040-6f3f-5555-bdad-85da6ddd1886"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1d1be747-8a94-5aed-aafa-3f8e379525df" :answer/id #uuid "1d1be747-8a94-5aed-aafa-3f8e379525df" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2-\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a6c9df96-aec1-55e9-a6fa-579b1f853ec1" :answer/id #uuid "a6c9df96-aec1-55e9-a6fa-579b1f853ec1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e0fc4746-3be8-5122-9467-181003e3756b" :answer/id #uuid "e0fc4746-3be8-5122-9467-181003e3756b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59823227-e905-5977-a5d2-bb84aa45354b" :answer/id #uuid "59823227-e905-5977-a5d2-bb84aa45354b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{8}\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2bcb7040-6f3f-5555-bdad-85da6ddd1886" :answer/id #uuid "2bcb7040-6f3f-5555-bdad-85da6ddd1886" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{m}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096719 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f371caa1-75a3-5280-8f9d-dfa2d56f63d8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-f371caa1-75a3-5280-8f9d-dfa2d56f63d8" :question/id #uuid "f371caa1-75a3-5280-8f9d-dfa2d56f63d8" :question/math-academy-id "q-83246" :question/problem "A golden eagle is moving in a straight line with a velocity of $v(t)=\\frac{{2}^{t}}{12}\\,\\text{m/s},$ where $t$ is the time in seconds. Find the average velocity of the golden eagle on the interval $[2,6].$" :question/worked-solution "To calculate the average value of the velocity on $[{t}_{1},{t}_{2}],$ we use the average value formula\n\n$$\n{v}_{\\text{avg}}=\\frac{1}{{t}_{2}-{t}_{1}}{\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}v(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{v}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{6-2}\\,{\\int }_{2}^{6}(\\frac{{2}^{t}}{12})\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4\\cdot 12\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡2}({2}^{t}){|}_{2}^{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{48\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}({2}^{6}-{2}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{60}{48\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average velocity is $\\frac{5}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{m/s}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7d349dd1-b5a9-5935-ae21-26e3ea46f260"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7d349dd1-b5a9-5935-ae21-26e3ea46f260" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d349dd1-b5a9-5935-ae21-26e3ea46f260" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-00674e18-ee02-59cd-b3dc-a6f698a1d859" :answer-field/choices ["answer-89c053ae-f87b-53b5-b9ff-dddaf3e41c2a" "answer-00674e18-ee02-59cd-b3dc-a6f698a1d859" "answer-910d3bad-81e3-5314-864f-7990eaa9b236" "answer-8fea7db7-de80-5d17-aee5-ba303c413efc" "answer-a5081cba-4b6f-5bf9-b175-aba9c3e125ed"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89c053ae-f87b-53b5-b9ff-dddaf3e41c2a" :answer/id #uuid "89c053ae-f87b-53b5-b9ff-dddaf3e41c2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{m/s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-00674e18-ee02-59cd-b3dc-a6f698a1d859" :answer/id #uuid "00674e18-ee02-59cd-b3dc-a6f698a1d859" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{m/s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-910d3bad-81e3-5314-864f-7990eaa9b236" :answer/id #uuid "910d3bad-81e3-5314-864f-7990eaa9b236" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{4}\\,\\text{m/s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8fea7db7-de80-5d17-aee5-ba303c413efc" :answer/id #uuid "8fea7db7-de80-5d17-aee5-ba303c413efc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{m/s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a5081cba-4b6f-5bf9-b175-aba9c3e125ed" :answer/id #uuid "a5081cba-4b6f-5bf9-b175-aba9c3e125ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{8}\\,\\text{m/s}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a23536ce-7cba-5974-838f-a84131e7f6d9" :question/id #uuid "a23536ce-7cba-5974-838f-a84131e7f6d9" :question/math-academy-id "q-83252" :question/problem "Find the average acceleration of a particle on the interval $[0,2]$ if its acceleration in ${\\text{mm/s}}^{2}$ is given by the function $a(t)={e}^{t}+2t,$ where $t$ is the time in seconds." :question/worked-solution "To calculate the average value of the acceleration on $[{t}_{1},{t}_{2}],$ we use the average value formula\n\n$$\n{a}_{\\text{avg}}=\\frac{1}{{t}_{2}-{t}_{1}}\\,{\\int }_{{t}_{1}}^{{t}_{2}}a(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nSo, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{1}{2-0}\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}({e}^{t}+2t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{t}+{t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}[({e}^{2}+{2}^{2})-({e}^{0}+{0}^{2})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}+4-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}+3).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average acceleration is $\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}+3)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-76075077-a9d5-595a-9adb-0f742d7f6853"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-76075077-a9d5-595a-9adb-0f742d7f6853" :answer-field/id #uuid "76075077-a9d5-595a-9adb-0f742d7f6853" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-db17edff-e21c-5200-a414-f3d057a203d4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a0081eee-8909-542d-b183-dcd4d72c126a" "answer-021687c4-7f27-5cfb-bfb5-dc034943da18" "answer-db17edff-e21c-5200-a414-f3d057a203d4" "answer-6afc054d-1902-5c8f-94a1-83ead8f48431" "answer-ec3107cf-6266-5c72-895b-2d1cbe80c372"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a0081eee-8909-542d-b183-dcd4d72c126a" :answer/id #uuid "a0081eee-8909-542d-b183-dcd4d72c126a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2e+3)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-021687c4-7f27-5cfb-bfb5-dc034943da18" :answer/id #uuid "021687c4-7f27-5cfb-bfb5-dc034943da18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "({e}^{2}+4)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-db17edff-e21c-5200-a414-f3d057a203d4" :answer/id #uuid "db17edff-e21c-5200-a414-f3d057a203d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}+3)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6afc054d-1902-5c8f-94a1-83ead8f48431" :answer/id #uuid "6afc054d-1902-5c8f-94a1-83ead8f48431" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}({e}^{2}-1)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec3107cf-6266-5c72-895b-2d1cbe80c372" :answer/id #uuid "ec3107cf-6266-5c72-895b-2d1cbe80c372" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}({e}^{2}+1)\\,{\\text{mm/s}}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186096718 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f05a5b67-91d9-5027-a739-e465c398f589" "question-a7420375-7675-57fc-8640-9f218c433ea5"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-f05a5b67-91d9-5027-a739-e465c398f589" :question/id #uuid "f05a5b67-91d9-5027-a739-e465c398f589" :question/math-academy-id "q-353941" :question/problem "A robotic sled moves along a straight track with velocity \n$v(t)={t}^{3}-t,$ where $t$ is measured in seconds and $v$ is measured in meters per second.\n\nFind the average acceleration ${a}_{\\text{avg}}$ over the time interval $t\\in [1,3].$ Do not round your answer.\n\n${a}_{\\text{avg}}=$ \n{{field-1}}\n${\\text{m/s}}^{2}$" :question/worked-solution "The average acceleration is the average rate of change of the velocity, so\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{v(b)-v(a)}{b-a} \\\\  & =\\frac{v(3)-v(1)}{3-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{[(3)^{3}-(3)]-[(1)^{3}-(1)]}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{(27-3)-(1-1)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{24-0}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{24}{2} \\\\  & =12\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average acceleration is $12\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4686715d-a18c-51be-a9b1-884139acad2f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4686715d-a18c-51be-a9b1-884139acad2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "4686715d-a18c-51be-a9b1-884139acad2f" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-37a3d483-228d-5bd2-9d7d-ce2ef8b4ae21" :answer-field/choices ["answer-37a3d483-228d-5bd2-9d7d-ce2ef8b4ae21"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-37a3d483-228d-5bd2-9d7d-ce2ef8b4ae21" :answer/id #uuid "37a3d483-228d-5bd2-9d7d-ce2ef8b4ae21" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a7420375-7675-57fc-8640-9f218c433ea5" :question/id #uuid "a7420375-7675-57fc-8640-9f218c433ea5" :question/math-academy-id "q-353947" :question/problem "A test cart moves in a straight line with velocity \n$v(t)=\\frac{3}{t},$ where $t$ is measured in seconds and $v$ is measured in feet per second.\n\nFind the average acceleration ${a}_{\\text{avg}}$ over the time interval $t\\in [1,3].$ Do not round your answer.\n\n${a}_{\\text{avg}}=$ \n{{field-1}}\n${\\text{ft/s}}^{2}$" :question/worked-solution "The average acceleration is the average rate of change of the velocity, so\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{\\text{avg}} & =\\frac{v(3)-v(1)}{3-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{[\\frac{3}{3}]-[\\frac{3}{1}]}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-3}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-2}{2} \\\\  & =-1\\,{\\text{ft/s}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average acceleration is $-1\\,{\\text{ft/s}}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1fb540b7-e7ae-5a07-bd6e-28e04440e173"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1fb540b7-e7ae-5a07-bd6e-28e04440e173" :answer-field/id #uuid "1fb540b7-e7ae-5a07-bd6e-28e04440e173" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-63c71e9a-e2a4-5acf-9c3f-1545635639b9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-63c71e9a-e2a4-5acf-9c3f-1545635639b9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-63c71e9a-e2a4-5acf-9c3f-1545635639b9" :answer/id #uuid "63c71e9a-e2a4-5acf-9c3f-1545635639b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-214227dc-fd64-5b29-a98a-53e4687a838c" :activity/id #uuid "214227dc-fd64-5b29-a98a-53e4687a838c" :activity/title "Average Position, Velocity, and Acceleration" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048976 :activity/course 17592186046645 :activity/steps 