17592186228525 :answer-field/choices 17592186228530] [:db/retract 17592186228525 :answer-field/choices 17592186228526] [:db/retract 17592186228525 :answer-field/choices 17592186228527] [:db/retract 17592186229721 :question/answer-fields 17592186228531] [:db/retract 17592186229721 :question/answer-fields 17592186228534] {:db/id 17592186229173 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-c68b418a-a9c2-512b-93fe-1e0b537572e9" "question-2c275290-69db-55d0-83e9-26518022c1c5"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186229174 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-f98d94e0-3737-5c43-aa65-d5af57241d7a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186229175 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-1c3a98af-770d-5596-b478-235b18fb3ea6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-c68b418a-a9c2-512b-93fe-1e0b537572e9" :question/id #uuid "c68b418a-a9c2-512b-93fe-1e0b537572e9" :question/math-academy-id "q-340768" :question/problem "$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx) \\\\ g(x) & ∼\\frac{{c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{c}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{d}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ be $2\\pi $-periodic extensions of some functions from $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ to $x\\in R$ with the Fourier series shown above. What is the $6\\text{th}$ Fourier sine coefficient of $-3f(x)-2g(x)?$" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ be $2\\pi $-periodic functions with Fourier series\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)), \\\\ g(x) & ∼\\frac{{c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({c}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{d}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen for any constants $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $,\n\n$$\n\\alpha f(x)+\\beta g(x)∼\\frac{\\alpha {a}_{0}+\\beta {c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }((\\alpha {a}_{n}+\\beta {c}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+(\\alpha {b}_{n}+\\beta {d}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nUsing the linearity property of Fourier series, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $-3f(x)-2g(x)$ are\n\n- $-3{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- $-3{a}_{n}-2{c}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $-3{b}_{n}-2{d}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the $6$th sine coefficient of $-3f(x)-2g(x)$ is\n\n$$\n-3{b}_{6}-2{d}_{6}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b50ec26a-cc99-5796-8813-5d5595ca224f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b50ec26a-cc99-5796-8813-5d5595ca224f" :answer-field/id #uuid "b50ec26a-cc99-5796-8813-5d5595ca224f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-369e06e2-73c3-5dd4-a343-09337ede43bc" "answer-539fdd72-d074-5ca4-bc19-a05dcd278d54" "answer-af9e08fd-f24c-56c3-9400-df7628dd678d" "answer-d8ef8838-eb42-5147-9f27-de7711e9fd4b" "answer-8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-369e06e2-73c3-5dd4-a343-09337ede43bc" :answer/id #uuid "369e06e2-73c3-5dd4-a343-09337ede43bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-539fdd72-d074-5ca4-bc19-a05dcd278d54" :answer/id #uuid "539fdd72-d074-5ca4-bc19-a05dcd278d54" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{a}_{6}-2{c}_{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-af9e08fd-f24c-56c3-9400-df7628dd678d" :answer/id #uuid "af9e08fd-f24c-56c3-9400-df7628dd678d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{b}_{0}-2{d}_{0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d8ef8838-eb42-5147-9f27-de7711e9fd4b" :answer/id #uuid "d8ef8838-eb42-5147-9f27-de7711e9fd4b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{b}_{6}-2{c}_{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7" :answer/id #uuid "8a1fe503-e29c-50c9-8135-cba5a2e7f1c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{b}_{6}-2{d}_{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2c275290-69db-55d0-83e9-26518022c1c5" :question/id #uuid "2c275290-69db-55d0-83e9-26518022c1c5" :question/math-academy-id "q-340760" :question/problem "$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx) \\\\ g(x) & ∼\\frac{{c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{c}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{d}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ be $2\\pi $-periodic extensions of some functions from $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ to $x\\in R$ with the Fourier series shown above. What is the constant Fourier coefficient of $-5f(x)-2g(x)?$" :question/worked-solution "Let $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ be $2\\pi $-periodic functions with Fourier series\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)), \\\\ g(x) & ∼\\frac{{c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({c}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{d}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen for any constants $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $,\n\n$$\n\\alpha f(x)+\\beta g(x)∼\\frac{\\alpha {a}_{0}+\\beta {c}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }((\\alpha {a}_{n}+\\beta {c}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+(\\alpha {b}_{n}+\\beta {d}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nUsing the linearity property of Fourier series, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $-5f(x)-2g(x)$ are\n\n- $-5{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- $-5{a}_{n}-2{c}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $-5{b}_{n}-2{d}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the constant Fourier coefficient of $-5f(x)-2g(x)$ is\n\n$$\n-5{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-535680db-da42-5bba-8fc2-25cdaf9fe573"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-535680db-da42-5bba-8fc2-25cdaf9fe573" :answer-field/id #uuid "535680db-da42-5bba-8fc2-25cdaf9fe573" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b9e73330-e560-5146-85cc-a129311d885d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b6dea7e4-04e0-5bca-8657-2e8013df7dfa" "answer-bf3ee227-aaac-5277-9bb8-c9a0551952a9" "answer-b9e73330-e560-5146-85cc-a129311d885d" "answer-d09345f0-8979-50d6-8e4c-ad18cbc88e66" "answer-30534d8b-c585-5664-86ff-6a8280445feb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b6dea7e4-04e0-5bca-8657-2e8013df7dfa" :answer/id #uuid "b6dea7e4-04e0-5bca-8657-2e8013df7dfa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{a}_{0}-5{c}_{0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bf3ee227-aaac-5277-9bb8-c9a0551952a9" :answer/id #uuid "bf3ee227-aaac-5277-9bb8-c9a0551952a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2{b}_{1}-5{d}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b9e73330-e560-5146-85cc-a129311d885d" :answer/id #uuid "b9e73330-e560-5146-85cc-a129311d885d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{a}_{0}-2{c}_{0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d09345f0-8979-50d6-8e4c-ad18cbc88e66" :answer/id #uuid "d09345f0-8979-50d6-8e4c-ad18cbc88e66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{a}_{1}-2{c}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30534d8b-c585-5664-86ff-6a8280445feb" :answer/id #uuid "30534d8b-c585-5664-86ff-6a8280445feb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{b}_{1}-2{d}_{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186229719 :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)$ be the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of a function from $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ to $x\\in R$ with the Fourier series shown above. What is the $4$th cosine Fourier coefficient of $f(x)-3?$" :question/worked-solution "The Fourier series of $f(x)$ is\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nRecall that if $C$ is a constant, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $f(x)+C$ are\n\n- ${a}_{0}+2C$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- ${a}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- ${b}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nIn our case, $C=-3.$ Therefore, $4$th cosine coefficient of $f(x)-3$ is ${a}_{4}$ (remains unchanged)." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186228519 :answer-field/correct "answer-811ee4f9-b298-5eaf-85a1-522913724520" :answer-field/choices ["answer-811ee4f9-b298-5eaf-85a1-522913724520" "answer-f755cdd8-90f0-5770-9a32-e38b0025efef" "answer-e6809b27-192b-5766-8f36-aa84f2832383" "answer-3858c36c-96a7-5e58-a735-afcdcbf9f948" "answer-32838383-195c-5e52-b20e-40b26d82c65c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-811ee4f9-b298-5eaf-85a1-522913724520" :answer/id #uuid "811ee4f9-b298-5eaf-85a1-522913724520" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}_{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f755cdd8-90f0-5770-9a32-e38b0025efef" :answer/id #uuid "f755cdd8-90f0-5770-9a32-e38b0025efef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}_{4}+3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e6809b27-192b-5766-8f36-aa84f2832383" :answer/id #uuid "e6809b27-192b-5766-8f36-aa84f2832383" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}_{4}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3858c36c-96a7-5e58-a735-afcdcbf9f948" :answer/id #uuid "3858c36c-96a7-5e58-a735-afcdcbf9f948" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}_{4}-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-32838383-195c-5e52-b20e-40b26d82c65c" :answer/id #uuid "32838383-195c-5e52-b20e-40b26d82c65c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{a}_{4}-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f98d94e0-3737-5c43-aa65-d5af57241d7a" :question/id #uuid "f98d94e0-3737-5c43-aa65-d5af57241d7a" :question/math-academy-id "q-340781" :question/problem "$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)$ be the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of a function from $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ to $x\\in R$ with the Fourier series shown above. What is the $7$th sine Fourier coefficient of $f(-x)?$" :question/worked-solution "The Fourier series of $f(x)$ is\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nRecall that the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $f(-x)$ are\n\n- ${a}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- ${a}_{n}$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $-{b}_{n}$ $n\\ge 1,$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the $7$th sine coefficient of $f(-x)$ is $-{b}_{7}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c0937dc5-3ee6-51bf-8cbf-009d6a1d471d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c0937dc5-3ee6-51bf-8cbf-009d6a1d471d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0937dc5-3ee6-51bf-8cbf-009d6a1d471d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6b2bb11f-802e-5b7e-a5e5-6469b637a4cf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-2bd89a27-c4c0-53aa-962f-0e5c6ddbfe2a" "answer-6b2bb11f-802e-5b7e-a5e5-6469b637a4cf" "answer-3f9653b6-553b-589f-934f-3613554f8e73" "answer-a403c4cc-8f2a-599c-bbc0-6590042d47dd" "answer-e1001811-ea46-5806-9d27-14901ea38eac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2bd89a27-c4c0-53aa-962f-0e5c6ddbfe2a" :answer/id #uuid "2bd89a27-c4c0-53aa-962f-0e5c6ddbfe2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{a}_{7}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6b2bb11f-802e-5b7e-a5e5-64